<title>UK: Babcock Intl sees delay hurting revenue.</title>
<headline>Babcock Intl sees delay hurting revenue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering firm Babcock International Group Plc said on Tuesday that a longer-than-expected delay on a contract would cut its 1997/98 sales revenue by 8.0 million stg.</p>
</text>
